00:55:44.920 --> 00:55:50.680
<v Ira Glass>Thanks this week to Life Partners Roland Moore, Mark Kim, Christine Woodhouse, and Ross Boucher.
<v Ira Glass>本周感谢生活合作伙伴Roland Moore、Mark Kim、Christine Woodhouse和Ross Boucher。

00:55:50.680 --> 00:56:00.380
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia, who, for some reason, always gets lots of questions from people this time of year about trick or treating.
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人Torey Malatia先生，不知何故，每年这个时候总是从人们那里得到关于不给糖就捣蛋的大量问题。

00:56:00.380 --> 00:56:07.100
<v Sam Busa>I'm 56. Aren't I too old? Or am I allowed to bring my dogs?
<v Sam Busa>我56岁了。我太老了吗？或者我可以带上我的狗吗？

00:56:07.100 --> 00:56:12.100
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
